79", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828087_2559498147887412_1952687404121699695_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SL-993iEmLYQ7kNvwEuxdHL&_nc_oc=Adqt9g2vRwCxbxRv7n4jJR2lH-lnRck7R49sNhmEV9h3c_rAT-X_kEFQP-H0JokDsrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNFSepgkx2qsT9u4vQGVJMKvXNulaj2pf5OeEoKTFM7uA&oe=6AE4BF50"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot 5.png", "id": "1008923508859132", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1008923512192465_1657679104192620239_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oAG-QGULyTgQ7kNvwEWjJ02&_nc_oc=AdowLHNsouCjdwE7zlF3ORsJjBdsg2nYkO_0B_uRkSl-4HhJfXNMOPJnRywyI02pWbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMf5xsEiJ210EgBSTlkt8H-FdcpRvvGdWtTF_22VwiqqA&oe=6AE4B1AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "InGameSplashScreen.png", "id": "1055414073668076", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824700_1055414080334742_70418541035655713_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WTFBwxxWT1UQ7kNvwH1x3LL&_nc_oc=AdrdbMnerjHZEzG7JeUVG9C3HUwVWT5Bs_97uHaWT8U9-2NSmHQayIsnG7ycO9gmj7o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM6aebHgddYHGCLU1TXToDrvedC3QZ79pbGExKVOyfmPA&oe=6AE491E9"}, "display_name": "Build the Future", "keywords": ["Building", "Crafting", "Driving"], "long_description": "# About the Game\nWhile in the simulation, your primary task is constructing structures step-by-step. You will cut down trees, process materials, and navigate challenging terrain in your vehicle to transport supplies to the construction site. Your goal is to produce the required materials and snap each piece into its exact position to assemble the structure.\n\n{2082289205711263}\n\n# About the Story\nYou play as Frank, a mercenary captured by the Company after his latest heist goes wrong. Instead of interrogating you directly, the Company traps his mind inside an advanced simulation. As you construct buildings on a deserted virtual island, the Company secretly monitors and analyzes his brain activity in the background.\n\n# How long to beat it?\nApproximately 18 hours for now.\n\n# What does \"Early Access\" mean?\nThis story unfolds in phases, and this Early Access release represents the first chapter of the journey. By playing the game and sharing your feedback, you will directly help shape its development and future content updates.\n\n# Support & Feedback\nIf you encounter any bugs or need assistance, simply click the \"SENER PROJECTS\" logo on the main menu to reach the support page (www.senerprojects.com/support) and contact me directly.\n\nNote on Localization: Some in-game translations are currently generated using machine translation and may not be 100% accurate. If you notice any translation errors or awkward phrasing, please let me know so I can improve them!", "short_description": "Would you want to build structures in VR?"}]}, "developer_name": "SENER PROJECTS", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/games/build-the-future/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SENER PROJECTS", "support_website_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/games/build-the-future", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja", "de", "fr", "it", "zh_CN", "zh_HK", "zh_TW", "es", "pt_BR", "pt", "ko", "ru", "pl", "nl", "tr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes