&oe=6AE4B5F7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Build the Future", "keywords": ["Building", "Crafting", "Driving"], "long_description": "# What is this game about?\nBuild the Future is an Early Access VR game. In \"Phase 1\" you are going to cut down trees, produce materials, and build structures in VR.\n\n# What do you mean by saying \"phase 1\"?\nThis is an **early access game**, which means **there will be more content** coming soon.\n\n# Tell me more about the gameplay\nYour main task is building structures for future citizens. To build a structure you need to take a job in the game. Management panel will show you what materials you are going to use and all you need to do is produce them. Then you need to transport those materials with your vehicle to the construction site. After all required materials transported, construction can begin.\n\nBuilding structures feels like putting together a jigsaw puzzle. All you need to do is put the right material into the correct spot and use your hammer to nail it if it requires.\n\n# I am having trouble about something, how do I contact with you?\nhttps://www.senerprojects.com/support", "short_description": "Would you like to build structures in VR?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/games/build-the-future/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SENER PROJECTS", "support_website_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/games/build-the-future", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb"